Z||000060||p4n1c||05-01-2001||02:20 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>...(people dont pull over or break their neck to watch an oldsmobile go by). Change your post to a nice, cute affordable car for mom. (LOL) Id go with the Z24 convert myself...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't think anyone would break their neck or would really want to watch a new Z24 convertable go by either.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">  Unless it was on fire.<P>Go for a first gen. Plymouth Laser or any gen.  Talon.  They are cheap to buy, the only downside is they are expensive to fix.  Especially the turbo models.  But they are small, sporty and head turners(especially the late model Talon's).<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)||||reg||1
